WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.520
SPEAKER 1: Welcome.

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:03.160
This video is
designed to show you

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.940
how Google Cloud certifications
can allow you to demonstrate

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.570
your skills, boost your career,
and thrive within the partner

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.350
program.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.750
We'll review the
partner-exclusive benefits

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:17.140
available to help you prepare
for becoming Google Cloud

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:18.790
Certified.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.610
Google Cloud is the
fastest growing cloud

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.760
with significant advantages
in big data processing

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.770
and analytics at scale.

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:29.470
Whether you're just beginning
your career in cloud

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:32.560
or have more experience
with other cloud solutions,

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.410
validating your technical
expertise by getting Google

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.840
Cloud Certified will
help you demonstrate

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.700
that you have the
critical skills

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.220
to drive business
success in today's highly

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.720
competitive market.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:45.790
The Google Cloud
certification program

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:49.360
includes two levels of
certification-- professional

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.040
and associate.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:54.070
The associate certification
is focused on the core Google

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:57.160
Cloud Platform technology,
and it's a good starting point

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:00.160
for those who are new to
cloud in general or new

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.770
to Google Cloud
Platform specifically.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:04.599
The professional
certifications are

00:01:04.599 --> 00:01:08.500
job role-based certifications
and assess advanced design

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.320
and implementation
skills developed

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.560
through hands-on experience.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:15.260
These certifications are
focused on the core job

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.050
roles in cloud infrastructure,
data and machine

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:21.380
learning, application
development, networking,

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.800
and security.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:24.660
Now that we've
covered the basics,

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:27.230
let's talk about the steps
and partner-exclusive

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:30.980
resources available to help you
prepare for your Google Cloud

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.330
certification.

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:35.660
Your professional experience
is the most critical part

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:37.340
of the preparation journey.

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:39.740
Use the available
exam guides to gauge

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:41.870
how your skills and
knowledge match up

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:45.650
to the job skills that will be
evaluated in the certification

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:46.610
exam.

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:50.090
We're delighted to provide you
partner access to hands-on labs

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:53.130
and on-demand training courses.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:55.100
We also recommend
taking the practice

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:58.670
exams that are available
for our certifications.

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:00.902
These practice exams
will familiarize you

00:02:00.902 --> 00:02:02.360
with the types of
questions you may

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.700
encounter on the
certification exam

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.500
and help you determine
your readiness

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.350
or if you need more
preparation or experience.

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:12.480
You can find all these
partner-specific resources

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:15.380
including webinars, partner
certification kickstart,

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.470
promotions, and other events
on the Google Cloud Partner

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:19.740
Portal.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.640
We also recommend checking
out some additional resources

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:25.670
like our Google Cloud
documentation pages

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:27.740
or the Google Cloud
Platform YouTube

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:31.130
channel for videos and tutorials
on Google Cloud products

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.660
and solutions.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:35.540
We encourage you to visit the
Google Cloud certification

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:38.690
website for more information
and take the first step

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:42.500
to earn your badge and become
Google Cloud Certified.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.460
Thanks so much for watching.

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.040
We look forward
to seeing what you

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:50.620
accomplish with your next
Google Cloud certification.

